abstract: >-
  Open-source harness for adversarial test-case generation targeting eBPF
  verifier diagnostic honesty (bpfix / Zheng et al.), with construction-time
  injection oracles across PointerProvenance, ScalarRange, NullablePointer,
  and PacketBounds.
keywords:
  - eBPF
  - verifier
  - diagnostic honesty
  - adversarial testing
  - bpfix
  - software testing
